{'symbol': 'ON', 'date': '2023-02-24 07:00:00', 'title': 'ONSEMI ANNOUNCES UPSIZE AND PRICING OF PRIVATE OFFERING OF $1.3 BILLION OF 0.50% CONVERTIBLE SENIOR NOTES', 'text': "PHOENIX--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ON SEMICONDUCTOR CORPORATION (NASDAQ: ON) (“ONSEMI”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE PRICING OF ITS PRIVATE OFFERING OF $1.3 BILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 0.50% CONVERTIBLE SENIOR NOTES DUE 2029 (THE “NOTES”) AT A 32.5% PREMIUM TO THE CLOSING PRICE OF ONSEMI'S COMMON STOCK ON FEBRUARY 23, 2023, OF $78.39."}